{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18202190","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18202190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1820218001:0":{"text":"塞涅第一次演出扮演的角色是？","source_cn":"塞涅第一次演出扮演的角色是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9748B626047590D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820218002:0":{"text":"奥克塔维亚！","source_cn":"奥克塔维亚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59AB483F94FA5F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820219001:0":{"text":"问答比赛现场，薇薇娅依然在热火朝天地作答。看起来她答得非常顺利，一道题也没有答错。","source_cn":"问答比赛现场，薇薇娅依然在热火朝天地作答。看起来她答得...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x42D6C31970298C70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"问答比赛现场，薇薇娅依然在热火朝天地作答。看起来她答得非常顺利，一道题也没有答错。","female":"问答比赛现场，薇薇娅依然在热火朝天地作答。看起来她答得非常顺利，一道题也没有答错。","variant_male_record_index":"247377","variant_female_record_index":"247378","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820219002:0":{"text":"就在此时，你忽然听到背后有人用一种极为夸张的语调，唱出了一句不符合此情此景的台词，有些疑惑地回头看去——","source_cn":"就在此时，你忽然听到背后有人用一种极为夸张的语调，唱出...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC30709CEC6EAF5A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"就在此时，你忽然听到背后有人用一种极为夸张的语调，唱出了一句不符合此情此景的台词，有些疑惑地回头看去——","female":"就在此时，你忽然听到背后有人用一种极为夸张的语调，唱出了一句不符合此情此景的台词，有些疑惑地回头看去——","variant_male_record_index":"247379","variant_female_record_index":"247380","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820219003:1":{"text":"“抱歉，小姐，我不是故意打扰你，只是听到有人哭泣……”","source_cn":"“抱歉，小姐，我不是故意打扰你，只是听到有人哭泣……”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED1892AE51D630A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820219004:1":{"text":"——唉，毫无新意的台词。可以想见生者们依然用着多么庸俗的搭讪方式。","source_cn":"——唉，毫无新意的台词。可以想见生者们依然用着多么庸俗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA372F02DE8E76C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820219005:1":{"text":"好了，少些抱怨吧，朵蒂娜。我千辛万苦才托人拿到两张<style=\"highlight\">贵宾席</style>，特意邀请你欣赏塞涅的第一场演出，可不是为了听你那些永无止境的抱怨。","source_cn":"好了，少些抱怨吧，朵蒂娜。我千辛万苦才托人拿到两张<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25929A1E09AED9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820219006:1":{"text":"那你就该知道，碧翠逝，我对生者的东西向来嗤之以鼻。","source_cn":"那你就该知道，碧翠逝，我对生者的东西向来嗤之以鼻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EBED6AC351E0D1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820219007:1":{"text":"塞涅已经不是生者了，海歌剧院的导演和其他演员更是离世得很早。想必改编过的《消逝之声》肯定会兼具亡灵与生者的喜好。","source_cn":"塞涅已经不是生者了，海歌剧院的导演和其他演员更是离世得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FFD870E5A54BD80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820219008:1":{"text":"更何况——诺珐斯如今的潮流就是观看塞涅的演出，交流心得感悟。难道你想落伍于人，因此被布莉吉德她们嘲笑？","source_cn":"更何况——诺珐斯如今的潮流就是观看塞涅的演出，交流心得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5C7FFEA77C7200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820219009:1":{"text":"哼，我又没说不去看。","source_cn":"哼，我又没说不去看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3ADA6A211A18074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820219010:1":{"text":"但愿这场演出能让我满意，否则布莉吉德的品味就要跌入深海了。","source_cn":"但愿这场演出能让我满意，否则布莉吉德的品味就要跌入深海了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C78AF766286D9ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820219011:3":{"text":"不好意思……！我想请问一下，你们手里的贵宾席是怎么买到的……？","source_cn":"不好意思……！我想请问一下，你们手里的贵宾席是怎么买到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB06A31B7C59104E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820219012:1":{"text":"啊……偷渡者。麻烦不要和我搭话。","source_cn":"啊……偷渡者。麻烦不要和我搭话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x587B887BB23DCAF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820219013:0":{"text":"只有<style=\"highlight\">受到领主阁下器重的贵族</style>才有拿到贵宾席的荣幸。尤其我们手中的还是第一场正式演出的贵宾席，这可是有钱也买不到的。","source_cn":"只有<style=highlight>受到领主阁下器重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF6744684168531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820219014:0":{"text":"好了，别在我们面前乱晃。没看到朵蒂娜都因此头晕了吗？","source_cn":"好了，别在我们面前乱晃。没看到朵蒂娜都因此头晕了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4306E339A8AE634D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820219015:0":{"text":"<sad>对……对不起！亡灵果然好可怕！</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>对……对不起！亡灵果然好可怕！</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x099F0D91C991C8DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:问答比赛工作人员":{"text":"问答比赛工作人员","source":"问答比赛工作人员","status":"source"},"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"薇薇娅","source":"薇薇娅","status":"source"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"},"speaker:朵蒂娜":{"text":"朵蒂娜","source":"朵蒂娜","status":"source"},"speaker:碧翠逝":{"text":"碧翠逝","source":"碧翠逝","status":"source"},"speaker:拘谨的剧迷":{"text":"拘谨的剧迷","source":"拘谨的剧迷","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":6}}